    <p.1 id="Para-40">39.Here is a partial list of Amy Neustein’s subsequent editorials in Women’s eNews
on the protective mother issue. (A more complete list appears in the References):
<q>Family Court Drives Mothers to Suicide: Former Brooklyn Federal Prosecutor
is Latest Victim,</q> June 4, 2023; <q>Mothers Likewise Suffer from Poor ‘Debate’
Performance: But the Consequences are Far Worse,</q> July 14, 2024. These last
two, below, were co-authored with Michelle Etlin: <q>Mothers’ Vote
May Be Key to Kamala Harris Winning Nomination @=#x2014; and Defeating Trump,</q> July 23, 2024;
<q>Schumer’s No Kings Act Challenges the Sacrosanct Judiciary @=#x2014; While Giving
Hope to Mothers,</q> August 5, 2024.
</p.1>
    <!--end of p1 paragraph-->


<!--enter p.1-->
