a federal grant from the Legal Services Corporation, served as a legal research
and training center for women and family law.
</p.1>
<!--end of p1 paragraph-->


<!--enter p.1-->
<p.1 id="Para-240">4.<i>Guarding Our Children: A Review of Massachusetts’ Guardian Ad Litem Program
within the Probate and Family Court</i> (March 2001).
</p.1>
<!--end of p1 paragraph-->


<!--enter p.1-->
