<!--enter p.1-->
    <p.1 id="Para-378">64.The National Child Abuse and Neglect Data System, which collects data from all
fifty states@=#x2014;and prepares an annual report for the Children’s Bureau for the Administration on Children, Youth and Families of the US Department of Health
and Human Services@=#x2014;has studied this problem for thirteen years. The findings
of prior years have been more or less consistent with those in the 2002 report,
which is the most current.
</p.1>
    <!--end of p1 paragraph-->


